# Jw_cad itself is Jiro Shimizu & Yoshifumi Tanaka's.  Its licence allows
# passing it on, on two conditions: do not change the program, and pass it on
# in the form it came in (Jw_win.txt, section 3).
#
# By the owner's decision (2026-09-28) this repository carries the lot, so
# that anyone can follow the work without a copy of the program or a Ghidra
# run of their own:
#
#   jww10036.exe   the installer exactly as it downloads, unchanged
#   orig/          what that installer expands to -- the program itself
#   decomp/        Ghidra's output for Jw_win.exe, and decomp/res, which is
#                  the original's own bitmaps, menus and strings, plus the
#                  .jww files the original itself draws for the tests
#
# orig/ and decomp/ are therefore **not** "the form it came in": that
# condition is met by jww10036.exe alone.
install.log

tmp/
__pycache__/
*.o
tests/*.exe

# generated from your own copy of Jw_win.exe by tools/mkres.py and
# tools/btnmap.py -- machine output from someone else's program
src/gen/
tests/out/
jw_port.exe
sync.tgz
